# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This guide explains how to use the [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") to implement quantum algorithms directly in fermionic space, rather than mapping to qubits first.\n"
msgstr "このガイドでは、[`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")を使って、先にQubitへマッピングするのではなく、フェルミオン空間で直接クォンタム・アルゴリズムを実装する方法を説明します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Why use fermionic circuits {#why-use-fermionic-circuits}"
msgstr "フェルミオン・Circuitを使う理由 {#why-use-fermionic-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Consider the traditional workflow for implementing the time evolution of a fermionic Hamiltonian on a qubit-based architecture:\n"
msgstr "Qubitベースのアーキテクチャでフェルミオン・ハミルトニアンの時間発展を実装する、従来のワークフローを考えてみましょう。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '1.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Define the fermionic Hamiltonian (for example, $H = \\sum_{pq} h_{pq} c^\\dagger_p c_q$).\n"
msgstr "フェルミオン・ハミルトニアンを定義します(例:$H = \\sum_{pq} h_{pq} c^\\dagger_p c_q$)。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map it to a qubit operator (for example, by using the Jordan-Wigner mapping).\n"
msgstr "それをQubit演算子にマッピングします(例:Jordan-Wignerマッピングを使用)。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implement the time evolution in qubit space (using Trotterization or other methods).\n"
msgstr "Qubit空間で時間発展を実装します(トロッター分解やその他の手法を使用)。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This approach has a fundamental limitation; early mapping to qubits discards problem-aware knowledge about the fermionic structure. Standard optimization passes cannot exploit fermionic symmetries or allowed term reorderings, resulting in suboptimal circuits with unnecessary depths and gate counts.\n"
msgstr "このアプローチには根本的な限界があります。早い段階でQubitにマッピングすると、フェルミオン構造に関する問題固有の知識が失われてしまいます。標準的な最適化パスはフェルミオンの対称性や許容される項の並べ替えを利用できず、その結果、不要な深さとGate数を持つ最適でないCircuitになります。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") enables a better workflow:\n"
msgstr "[`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")を使うと、より良いワークフローになります。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '2.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Implement the time evolution directly in fermionic space using fermionic gates.\n"
msgstr "フェルミオン・Gateを使って、フェルミオン空間で直接時間発展を実装します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '3.  '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Map to qubit space as part of the transpilation process.\n"
msgstr "トランスパイル処理の一環として、Qubit空間にマッピングします。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This approach addresses the limitation by keeping problem-aware knowledge in fermionic space, where optimization passes can exploit fermionic structure and commutation relations to reduce circuit depth. The fermionic circuit describes what computation to perform, while transpilation handles how to map it to qubits, providing a cleaner separation of concerns.\n"
msgstr "このアプローチでは、問題固有の知識をフェルミオン空間に保持することで限界に対処します。フェルミオン空間では、最適化パスがフェルミオン構造や可換関係を利用してCircuitの深さを減らせます。フェルミオン・Circuitは「どのような計算を行うか」を記述し、トランスパイルは「それをQubitにどうマッピングするか」を担当するため、関心事がより明確に分離されます。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Generic mode indexing {#generic-mode-indexing}"
msgstr "汎用的なモード・インデックス {#generic-mode-indexing}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Both the [`operators`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators#module-qiskit_fermions.operators \"qiskit_fermions.operators\") module and the [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") use generic mode-based indexing that makes no assumptions about the nature of the modes. A mode is simply an abstract index labeling a fermionic degree of freedom, with no inherent semantics. This design choice mirrors the operators module and ensures maximum flexibility. For example, you can implement time evolution for any operator implementing the [`OperatorTrait`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-operator-trait#qiskit_fermions.operators.OperatorTrait \"qiskit_fermions.operators.OperatorTrait\") protocol, regardless of its mathematical representation.\n"
msgstr "[`operators`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators#module-qiskit_fermions.operators \"qiskit_fermions.operators\")モジュールと[`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")はどちらも、モードの性質について何も仮定しない汎用的なモード・ベースのインデックスを使用します。モードとは、フェルミオンの自由度に付けられた抽象的なインデックスにすぎず、固有の意味は持ちません。この設計はoperatorsモジュールと同様であり、最大限の柔軟性を確保します。たとえば、[`OperatorTrait`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/operators-operator-trait#qiskit_fermions.operators.OperatorTrait \"qiskit_fermions.operators.OperatorTrait\")プロトコルを実装している演算子であれば、その数学的表現に関係なく、時間発展を実装できます。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Build a fermionic circuit {#build-a-fermionic-circuit}"
msgstr "フェルミオン・Circuitを構築する {#build-a-fermionic-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The example below implements the time evolution described in the previous section. It constructs a [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") by specifying the number of fermionic modes, then adds fermionic gates from the [`qiskit_fermions.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit.library \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library\") to implement the time evolution.\n"
msgstr "以下の例では、前のセクションで説明した時間発展を実装します。フェルミオン・モードの数を指定して[`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")を構築し、[`qiskit_fermions.circuit.library`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library#module-qiskit_fermions.circuit.library \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library\")のフェルミオン・Gateを追加して時間発展を実装します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The example also demonstrates how to incorporate domain knowledge into an operator by using [operator term grouping](grouping#grouping-explanation). By assigning group indices to the Hamiltonian terms, you preserve structural information that optimization passes can exploit throughout the transpilation stack.\n"
msgstr "この例では、[演算子の項のグルーピング](grouping#grouping-explanation)を使って、演算子にドメイン知識を組み込む方法も示します。ハミルトニアンの項にグループ・インデックスを割り当てることで、トランスパイル・スタック全体を通じて最適化パスが利用できる構造情報を保持できます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A simple \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with a single time evolution gate.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-2.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A simple \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with a single time evolution gate.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-2.avif)\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A decomposed \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with several time evolution gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-3.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A decomposed \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with several time evolution gates.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-3.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Notice how the operator term grouping is preserved even in simple operations like decomposition. This demonstrates how structural information flows through the circuit stack. To understand the full transpilation to qubits, refer to the [Transpiling fermionic circuits](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) guide.\n"
msgstr "分解のような単純な操作でも、演算子の項のグルーピングが保持されることに注目してください。これは、構造情報がCircuitスタックの中をどのように流れていくかを示しています。Qubitへの完全なトランスパイルについては、[フェルミオン・Circuitのトランスパイル](transpilation#transpilation-explanation)ガイドを参照してください。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Keep gates apart with a barrier {#keep-gates-apart-with-a-barrier}"
msgstr "バリアでGateを分離する {#keep-gates-apart-with-a-barrier}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The optimization passes fuse neighboring gates where they can. For example, [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") combines a run of consecutive [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates into one, and [`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\") folds an [`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\") into the rotation that follows it.\n"
msgstr "最適化パスは、可能な場合は隣接するGateを融合します。たとえば、[`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\")は連続する[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\")Gateの並びを1つにまとめ、[`MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-slater-determinant-preparation#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeSlaterDeterminantPreparation\")は[`InitializeModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-initialize-modes#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.InitializeModes\")を、それに続く回転に畳み込みます。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use [`FermionicCircuit.barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\") when you want to prevent that. A barrier carries no unitary effect, so it does not change the state your circuit prepares; it only marks a point that the passes do not fuse across. Call it without arguments to span every mode, or pass the modes to restrict it to:\n"
msgstr "これを防ぎたい場合は、[`FermionicCircuit.barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\")を使用します。バリアにはユニタリ作用がないため、Circuitが準備する状態は変わりません。バリアは、パスが融合を行わない境界を示すだけです。引数なしで呼び出すとすべてのモードにまたがり、モードを渡すとそのモードに限定できます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with a barrier separating two orbital rotations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-5.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with a barrier separating two orbital rotations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-5.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Barriers survive the fermion-to-qubit transpilation, so they also constrain the qubit-level optimization that follows. The [Transpile fermionic circuits](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) guide covers that stage.\n"
msgstr "バリアはフェルミオンからQubitへのトランスパイル後も残るため、その後のQubitレベルの最適化にも制約を与えます。この段階については、[フェルミオン・Circuitのトランスパイル](transpilation#transpilation-explanation)ガイドで説明しています。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repeat a circuit {#repeat-a-circuit}"
msgstr "Circuitを繰り返す {#repeat-a-circuit}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Many algorithms apply the same block of gates many times over. Time evolution is the common case: a Trotter step is built once, then repeated to reach the target time. Use [`repeat()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat\") to build the repeated circuit, and [`compose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.compose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.compose\") to join it to a state preparation prefix.\n"
msgstr "多くのアルゴリズムでは、同じGateのブロックを何度も適用します。時間発展が典型的な例です。トロッター・ステップを一度構築し、目標の時間に達するまで繰り返します。繰り返しCircuitを構築するには[`repeat()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat\")を、それを状態準備のプレフィックスに結合するには[`compose()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.compose \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.compose\")を使用します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The example below builds a second-order Trotter step for a Fermi-Hubbard model. The step is symmetric: it splits the hopping term into two half-duration [`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\") gates surrounding the on-site interaction.\n"
msgstr "以下の例では、Fermi-Hubbardモデルの2次のトロッター・ステップを構築します。このステップは対称的です。ホッピング項を、オンサイト相互作用を挟む、時間幅が半分の2つの[`OrbitalRotation`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-orbital-rotation#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.OrbitalRotation\")Gateに分割します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Repeating the step and composing it onto a Hartree-Fock reference gives the full evolution:\n"
msgstr "このステップを繰り返し、Hartree-Fock参照状態に結合すると、完全な時間発展が得られます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with repeated steps.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-8.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with repeated steps.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-8.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The repetitions are flattened into the returned circuit rather than wrapped in a single gate, so [`count_ops()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.count_ops \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.count_ops\") counts two rotations per step. That flattening is what makes the redundancy at the step boundaries visible to the transpiler: the trailing half-duration rotation of one step and the leading one of the next are adjacent, so [`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\") combines them into a single rotation.\n"
msgstr "繰り返しは単一のGateにまとめられるのではなく、返されるCircuitに展開されるため、[`count_ops()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.count_ops \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.count_ops\")ではステップごとに2つの回転が数えられます。この展開によって、ステップの境界にある冗長性がTranspilerから見えるようになります。あるステップの末尾の半分の時間幅の回転と、次のステップの先頭の回転が隣接するため、[`MergeOrbitalRotations`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-merge-orbital-rotations#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.MergeOrbitalRotations\")がそれらを1つの回転にまとめます。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with repeated steps and merged orbital rotations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-10.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with repeated steps and merged orbital rotations.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-10.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The result costs one rotation per step plus one, which is what you get by fusing those half-steps by hand. Writing the step in its natural symmetric form and repeating it produces the same circuit, so the fusion is left to the optimization stage.\n"
msgstr "結果のコストは、ステップごとに1回転、さらに1回転が加わったものになります。これは、半ステップを手作業で融合した場合と同じです。ステップを自然な対称形で記述して繰り返せば同じCircuitが得られるため、融合は最適化の段階に任せることができます。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "When you need the repetitions kept apart, pass `insert_barriers=True` to place a [`barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\") between them. The optimization passes do not fuse gates across a barrier, so every rotation survives:\n"
msgstr "繰り返しを分離したままにしたい場合は、`insert_barriers=True`を渡して、それらの間に[`barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\")を配置します。最適化パスはバリアをまたいでGateを融合しないため、すべての回転が残ります。\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with repeated steps separated by barriers.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-12.avif)\n"
msgstr "![A \\`FermionicCircuit\\` with repeated steps separated by barriers.](/docs/images/addons/qiskit-fermions/circuit-12.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  The `reps` argument of [`FermionicSuzukiTrotter`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-suzuki-trotter#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSuzukiTrotter \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSuzukiTrotter\") is a different concept. It subdivides a single [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") gate into more, shorter factors, whereas [`repeat()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat\") duplicates whole circuits. Repeating a circuit that holds one [`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\") only multiplies its total evolution time.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`FermionicSuzukiTrotter`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-synthesis-fermionic-suzuki-trotter#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSuzukiTrotter \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.synthesis.FermionicSuzukiTrotter\")の`reps`引数は、別の概念です。これは1つの[`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\")Gateを、より短い多数の因子に細分化します。一方、[`repeat()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.repeat\")はCircuit全体を複製します。1つの[`Evolution`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-evolution#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.Evolution\")を含むCircuitを繰り返しても、全体の時間発展の時間が増えるだけです。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measure fermionic modes {#measure-fermionic-modes}"
msgstr "フェルミオン・モードを測定する {#measure-fermionic-modes}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "[`measure_all()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure_all \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure_all\") reads every mode out into a classical bit of its own, pairing mode `i` with bit `i`. Use [`measure()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure\") with your own [`ClassicalRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.ClassicalRegister) to read out only some of them.\n"
msgstr "[`measure_all()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure_all \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure_all\")は、すべてのモードをそれぞれ専用の古典ビットに読み出し、モード`i`をビット`i`に対応付けます。一部のモードだけを読み出すには、独自の[`ClassicalRegister`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/circuit#qiskit.circuit.ClassicalRegister)とともに[`measure()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.measure\")を使用します。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Passing `inplace=False` returns a measured copy and leaves the original alone, which matters because a measurement is not unitary: a circuit carrying one can no longer be applied to a state vector, so keep an unmeasured circuit around if you also want to simulate it.\n"
msgstr "`inplace=False`を渡すと、測定を加えたコピーが返され、元のCircuitはそのまま残ります。測定はユニタリではなく、測定を含むCircuitはもはや状態ベクトルに適用できないため、シミュレーションも行いたい場合は測定していないCircuitを手元に残しておいてください。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Measuring here, rather than on the transpiled [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit), is what keeps the sampled bitstrings easy to read. A fermionic measurement names the mode it reads, so every stage that moves modes around ([`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\") at the fermionic level, layout and routing at the qubit level) carries the measurement along with it, and the bitstring stays indexed by the mode you asked about.\n"
msgstr "トランスパイル後の[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)ではなく、ここで測定することで、サンプリングされたビット列が読み取りやすくなります。フェルミオン測定は読み出すモードを名前で指定するため、モードを移動させるすべての段階(フェルミオンレベルの[`RelabelModes`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/transpiler-passes-relabel-modes#qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes \"qiskit_fermions.transpiler.passes.RelabelModes\")、Qubitレベルのレイアウトとルーティング)が測定も一緒に運びます。そのため、ビット列は、指定したモードに対応したインデックスのままになります。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  Unlike [`measure_all()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all), no [`barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\") is inserted before the measurements. Call [`barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\") yourself first if you want one there.\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition title=\"Note\" type=\"note\">\n"
"  [`measure_all()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit#measure_all)とは異なり、測定の前に[`barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\")は挿入されません。バリアが必要な場合は、先に自分で[`barrier()`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit.barrier\")を呼び出してください。\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"  Whether a measured bit means what you expect depends on the fermion-to-qubit encoding, which is chosen during transpilation rather than here. Under an occupation-basis encoding such as Jordan-Wigner each mode is carried by one qubit and the bit is that mode’s occupation; see [`FermionicMeasure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-fermionic-measure#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.FermionicMeasure \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.FermionicMeasure\").\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"  測定されたビットが期待どおりの意味を持つかどうかは、ここではなくトランスパイル中に選ばれるフェルミオン-Qubitエンコーディングによって決まります。Jordan-Wignerのような占有基底のエンコーディングでは、各モードは1つのQubitで表され、ビットはそのモードの占有数になります。詳しくは[`FermionicMeasure`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-library-fermionic-measure#qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.FermionicMeasure \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.library.FermionicMeasure\")を参照してください。\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Transpile fermionic circuits {#transpile-fermionic-circuits}"
msgstr "フェルミオン・Circuitをトランスパイルする {#transpile-fermionic-circuits}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To implement the quantum algorithm represented by your [`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\") it must be transpiled to a [`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit). You can learn how to do this in the [Transpile fermionic circuits](transpilation#transpilation-explanation) guide.\n"
msgstr "[`FermionicCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-fermions/circuit-fermionic-circuit#qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit \"qiskit_fermions.circuit.FermionicCircuit\")が表すクォンタム・アルゴリズムを実行するには、それを[`QuantumCircuit`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit/qiskit.circuit.QuantumCircuit)にトランスパイルする必要があります。その方法は、[フェルミオン・Circuitのトランスパイル](transpilation#transpilation-explanation)ガイドで学べます。\n"

